    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When I woke up, I found myself transported to an alternate universe. Facing all kinds of girls, how should I make a choice? <br><br>This is a story of love with a plot twist. In the game, you not only need to maintain your favorable impression of each girl, but also have to figure out the hidden secrets behind them. <br><br>Be cautious of those girls who have an inexplicable fondness for you, for perhaps there are secrets behind their affection that are unknown to others. <br><br>At the same time, you also need to find the girl who truly devoted herself to you behind the scenes, and together with her, you should escape from this situation. <br><br><br><br><br><br>We are planning to release a demo version of the new product for the upcoming festival. We sincerely welcome your diverse opinions. <br><br><br><br><br><br>Production team <br><br>Producer: Youyouzi <br><br>Art: Gao Xiaohua <br><br>Program: Chi Yue <br><br>System: Flow Song <br><br>About Us <br><br>Welcome to join the group chat and follow the latest updates of &quot;Flowing Moon's Peace and Happiness&quot;: <br><br>QQ Group: 776282438</p>",
